   "sid": "s1",
   "date": null,
   "url": "https://www.thedartmouth.com/article/2026/10/holty-cia-deputy-director-michael-ellis-06-discusses-ai-and-china-at-davidson-institute-event",
   "text": "Tasks that would have taken people months or years to achieve could now be done in hours or days",
