  {
   "sid": "s3",
   "date": null,
   "url": "https://www.nextgov.com/artificial-intelligence/2026/04/cia-plans-ai-coworkers-deputy-director-says/412744/",
   "text": "It won’t do the thinking for our analysts, but it will help draft key judgments, edit for clarity and compare drafts against tradecraft standards",
