  {
   "sid": "s4",
   "date": null,
   "url": "https://federalnewsnetwork.com/intelligence-community/2026/02/cia-emphasizes-speed-under-new-acquisition-framework/",
   "text": "We’re entering a range of commercial partnerships, from startups to industry leaders, in areas like AI, biotech, FinTech, and microelectronics",
